WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Qala endlini, ku-zone eyiziro. Cabanga ngezindawo ozivakashela kakhulu.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
I-zone yokuqala iseduze komnyango. Iya engadini nsuku zonke.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Gcina izihlahla zezithelo eduze ku-zone yesibili.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Insimu enkulu ikude ku-zone yesithathu. Yivakashele uma kudingeka.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Ku-zone yesine kunezinkuni. Shiya i-zone yesihlanu iyindle.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Vumela amanzi, imithambeka nezindlela kulolonge ama-zone. Sebenzisa afanele indawo yakho.
